        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Many of these can be included in the tour price if you\u0027d prefer. For example, we can include entrance fees, gratuities, or audio headphones as part of your overall cost."
